---
title: "Daily Operational Sequence"
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant CRON as ⏰ Cron Scheduler
    participant MI as 🔍 Market Intel
    participant API as 🖥️ FastAPI
    participant COORD as 🎯 Coordinator
    participant CVT as 📝 CV Tailor
    participant CL as ✉️ Cover Letter
    participant SLACK as 💬 Slack
    participant NICK as 👤 Nick
    participant AT as 📊 App Tracker

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over CRON,AT: 07:00 — Morning Scan
        CRON->>MI: Trigger morning scan
        MI->>API: POST /jobs/refresh
        API-->>MI: OK (Adzuna fetch started)
        Note over MI: Wait 45 seconds
        MI->>API: GET /jobs?status=new&min_score=0.75
        API-->>MI: [12 new matches]
        MI->>MI: Score & assess each match
        MI->>MI: Write leads/2026-02-15.md
        MI->>SLACK: Post summary to #job-search
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over CRON,AT: 07:15 — Daily Planning
        CRON->>COORD: Trigger daily planning
        COORD->>COORD: Read today's lead report
        COORD->>API: GET /stats
        COORD->>API: GET /api/agents/follow-ups-due
        Note over COORD: Prioritise: 3 high-score jobs,<br/>2 follow-ups due
        
        par Prepare materials for top job
            COORD->>MI: sessions_spawn: Research Barclays
            MI->>MI: Web search + company intel
            MI-->>COORD: Research complete
            COORD->>CVT: sessions_spawn: Tailor CV for job #247
            CVT->>API: GET /jobs/247
            CVT->>CVT: Read master-cv.md, tailor
            CVT-->>COORD: CV written
            COORD->>CL: sessions_spawn: Draft cover letter
            CL->>CL: Read research + CV, draft letter
            CL-->>COORD: Cover letter written
        end

        COORD->>COORD: Review materials quality
        COORD->>SLACK: Post to #job-search:<br/>"Materials ready for Barclays"
        COORD->>SLACK: Post daily briefing to #job-search
    end

    rect rgb(255, 255, 240)
        Note over NICK,AT: Nick Reviews (async)
        NICK->>SLACK: "approved" on Barclays materials
        Note over COORD: Heartbeat picks up approval
        COORD->>AT: sessions_spawn: Log application
        AT->>API: PATCH /jobs/247 status=applied
        AT->>AT: Schedule follow-ups (Day 7, 14, 21)
        AT->>SLACK: Post to #job-search:<br/>"Applied to Barclays Director role"
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over CRON,AT: Every 4 hours — Pipeline Check
        CRON->>AT: Trigger pipeline monitoring
        AT->>API: GET /api/agents/follow-ups-due
        AT->>SLACK: "Follow-up due: Goldman Sachs<br/>Applied 7 days ago. Draft ready."
    end
